[00:00.00] I trust that everyone is enjoying the music.
[00:04.00] As the title of the album suggests,
[00:08.00] this was meant for your listening pleasure while you are being done in.
[00:17.00] However, anyone may listen.
[00:20.00] We have no intention to discriminate.
[00:23.00] After all, the murderer has as much right to enjoy himself as his victim.
[00:30.00] Which brings me to this very practical aspect of our album.
[00:35.00] If you turn the volume up very loud, it will drown out screams.
